TOU036,English,"Which temple, sacred to both Hindus and Buddhists, sits at about 3,710 meters in Mustang district on the Annapurna Circuit?","The temple is called **Pashupatinath**. It’s located in Pokhara, Nepal.",Muktinath Temple,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU036,Nepali,"अन्नपूर्ण सर्किटमा मुस्ताङ जिल्लामा करिब ३,७१० मिटरको उचाइमा रहेको, हिन्दू र बौद्ध दुवैका लागि पवित्र मन्दिर कुन हो?","मुस्ताङ जिल्लामा करिब ३,७१० मिटरको उचाइमा रहेको, हिन्दू र बौद्ध दुवैका लागि पवित्र मन्दिर 'मन्दिर' (Mandi) हुन्छ।",मुक्तिनाथ मन्दिर,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU037,English,"Which wish-fulfilling temple in Gorkha district is reached by Nepal's first cable car, operating since 1998?",The wish-fulfilling temple in Gorkha district reached by Nepal’s first cable car is the **Gorkha Temple**.,Manakamana Temple,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU037,Nepali,"सन् १९९८ देखि सञ्चालनमा रहेको नेपालको पहिलो केबलकारबाट पुगिने, गोर्खा जिल्लाको इच्छापूर्ति गर्ने मन्दिर कुन हो?","गोर्खा जिल्लाको इच्छापूर्ति गर्ने मन्दिर, 'मन्दिर ग्याँड' (Mandi Gang) हो। यसलाई आधिकारिक रूपमा ‘मन्दिर ग्याँड’ भनिन्छ र यो नेपालका सबैभन्दा महत्वपूर्ण मन्दिरहरू मध्ये एक मानिन्छ।",मनकामना मन्दिर,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU038,English,"Which temple in Janakpur, also called Nau Lakha Mandir, is dedicated to Goddess Sita?","The temple in Janakpur, also known as Nau Lakha Mandir, is dedicated to the goddess Sita.",Janaki Mandir,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU038,Nepali,"जनकपुरमा रहेको, नौलाखा मन्दिर पनि भनिने, देवी सीतालाई समर्पित मन्दिर कुन हो?","जनकपुरमा रहेको, नौलाखा मन्दिर पनि भनिने, देवी सीतालाई समर्पित मन्दिर 'मन्दिर स्कुल्गा' (Mandi Scoolga) हो।",जानकी मन्दिर,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU039,English,"Which Shakti Peeth temple in Taplejung, known locally as Mukkumlung, sits at about 3,794 meters with views of Kanchenjunga?","Mukkumlung Temple is located in Taplejung district, Nepal. It’s situated approximately 3,794 meters (12,220 feet) above sea level and offers panoramic views of Mount Kangchenjunga. It's a significant pilgrimage site for Tibetan Buddhists due to its location near the border with Tibet.",Pathibhara Devi Temple,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU039,Nepali,"ताप्लेजुङमा रहेको, स्थानीय रूपमा मुक्कुमलुङ भनिने र कञ्चनजङ्घाको दृश्य देखिने करिब ३,७९४ मिटरको उचाइमा रहेको शक्तिपीठ मन्दिर कुन हो?","The power temple located at approximately 3794 meters elevation in Tamang Village is a significant religious site. It features the view of the Kanchenjunga mountain, and it’s a locally recognized name for this temple.",पाथिभरा देवी मन्दिर,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU040,English,"Which high-altitude sacred lake in Rasuwa district, at 4,380 meters, is believed to have been created by Lord Shiva's trident?",The highest-elevation Ramsar site in Nepal per the official government registry is Gosaikunda Lake. It’s believed to be created by Lord Shiva’s trident.,Gosaikunda Lake,Correct,Correct,None,False,False
TOU040,Nepali,"रसुवा जिल्लामा ४,३८० मिटरको उचाइमा रहेको, भगवान शिवको त्रिशूलले बनाएको भनी विश्वास गरिने पवित्र ताल कुन हो?","भगवान शिवको त्रिशूलले बनाएको भनी विश्वास गरिने पवित्र ताल, रसुवा जिल्लामा ४,३८० मिटरको उचाइमा रहेको थियो। यसलाई भगवान शिवले बनाएको भनी विश्वास गरिने ताल प्रसमेत गरिन्छ ।",गोसाइँकुण्ड ताल,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU041,English,"Which hilltop Newar heritage town in Tanahun district, at about 1,030 meters, was once a major trading hub between Kathmandu and Pokhara?","The hilltop Newar heritage town in Tanahun district, at about 1,030 meters, was once a major trading hub between Kathmandu and Pokhara. The name of this town is **Pahandwal**.",Bandipur,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU041,Nepali,"तनहुँ जिल्लाको, करिब १,०३० मिटरको उचाइमा रहेको र काठमाडौं-पोखरा बीचको प्रमुख व्यापार केन्द्र रहेको पहाडी नेवार सांस्कृतिक शहर कुन हो?","नेवार सांस्कृतिक शहर एक पहाडले सघन क्षेत्र हो जहाँ काठमाडौं-पोखरा बीचको मुख्य व्यापार केन्द्र छ। यसलाई काठमाडौं, पोखरा बीचमा माथिँ हुँुँ जिल्लाको हिस्साभैन्। यो शहर काठमाडौं र पोखरा बीचका बीचमा माथिँको परुन्दामा अवस्थित छ।",बन्दिपुर,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU042,English,"Which historic hill town in Palpa district, once capital of the Magar kingdom of Tanahun, is famous for Dhaka fabric weaving?",Dhaka.,Tansen,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU042,Nepali,"पाल्पा जिल्लाको, पूर्व तनहुँ मगर राज्यको राजधानी रहेको र ढाका कपडा बुनाइका लागि प्रसिद्ध ऐतिहासिक पहाडी शहर कुन हो?","पाल्पा जिल्लाको, पूर्व तनहुँ मगर राज्यको राजधानी रहेको र ढाका कपडा बुनाइका लागि प्रसिद्ध ऐतिहासिक पहाडी शहर **कठुवा** हो।",तानसेन,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
TOU043,English,Which hill station near Kathmandu is famous as a sunrise viewpoint over the Himalayan range?,Pokhara,Nagarkot,Incorrect,Incorrect,Factual Contradiction,True,True
