XLANG007,English,"How much foreign exchange did Nepal earn from tourism, per WTTC's cited figure exceeding NPR 75 billion?","According to the World Travel & Tourism Council’s (WTTC) data, Nepal earned approximately $75.4 billion in tourist revenue during 2023. This represents a significant increase from previous years and highlights Nepal's growing appeal as a tourism destination.

