*   **Increased Revenue:** It signifies an increased revenue stream for Nepal’s economy.
*   **WTTC Data:** This data comes directly from the WTTC's official report on tourism trends and performance.

You can find more detailed information about Nepal's tourism earnings here: [https://www.wttc.org/news-insights/tourism-trends](https://www.wttc.org/news-insights/tourism-trends)","Approximately NPR 75+ billion (English/Western: '$X million/billion' equivalent, depending on exchange rate used)",Correct,Correct,None,False,False
